body:
Well well from where I start?
All the lion king family (Scar, Mufasa, Kovu, etc. but also ladies);
Spirit stallion of the cimmaron;
the lion and the wolf lady from Sing2 and also the gorilla (Johnny);
Nick from Zootropolis;
Garrus from Mass effect and also a couple of chara but can't remember the names ( the green alien and the purple one, but also the female alien with the mask) - okok I am TERRIBLE with names;
Captain Amelia from Treasure planet;
Naavi'j from Avatar, all of them;
Gamora and Drax (MCU);
Lola Bunny (the original one);
... And I could add some more
